sentences.text:
Instant writ petition has been filed for a Writ of Mandamus, forbearing Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration, Chennai;
District Collector, Villupuram District; Revenue Divisional Officer, Kallakurichi Revenue Division,
Villupuram District; Joint Director, Municipal Administration, Vellore Region, Vellore;
Commissioner, Kallakurichi Municipality, Villupuram District; Designated Officer/Food Safety Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administration, http://www.judis.nic.in Villupuram District; Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI), New Delhi, the respondents 3 to 9, from allowing or granting permission, to run/operate the 10th Respondent's sweet manufacturing factories/units viz., Sri Vasavi Sweets and Backery at Thirumalai Thirupathi Nagar, Katchirayapalayam Road,
Kallakurichi - 606 202 without permission/licence from the concerned authorities, under the provisions of Tamil Nadu District Municipalities Act 1920 and Food Safety Act 2006, and consequently, to direct the Commissioner for Municipal Administration, Department of Municipal Administration, Chennai; Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration,
Chennai; District Collector, Villupuram District; Revenue Divisional Officer, Kallakurichi Revenue Division, Villupuram District; Joint Director, Municipal Administration, Vellore Region, Vellore;
respondents 2 to 6, to take appropriate action, against Commissioner, Kallakurichi Municipality,
Villupuram District and Sri Vasavi Sweets and Backery, represented by its Sole Proprietor,
Villupuram District, respondents 7 and 10, for their illegalities and violation of rules.
